1
00:01:17,160 --> 00:01:19,720
In heaven, we shall be birds flying side by side.

2
00:01:19,720 --> 00:01:22,380
On earth, we shall be branches twined together.

3
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:26,360
Chen,

4
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:28,200
spending one night with you

5
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:30,730
is better than three years with Zhao Huaijin.

6
00:01:37,520 --> 00:01:38,640
Liu Rumei,

7
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:40,039
you knelt before me and swore

8
00:01:40,039 --> 00:01:41,440
to love me for a lifetime.

9
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:42,440
And now look at you.

10
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:44,320
You took off your clothes and rolled around with Chen Wenyuan.

11
00:01:44,320 --> 00:01:46,520
What a stinking, despicable pair of dogs.

12
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:47,440
Lady Hong,

13
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:49,720
don't you hate those who break their oaths and betray their lovers the most?

14
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:51,440
Today, I swear by my blood.

15
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:53,479
Drag them to hell for me.

16
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:28,120
Chen!

17
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:42,680
Didn't you want to be together forever?

18
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:43,920
Fine.

19
00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:46,720
I will grant your wish.

20
00:02:46,720 --> 00:02:47,960
I want you to be together,

21
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:50,920
together for all eternity.

22
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:08,800
Make way.

23
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,680
Lord Su is here.

24
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:11,840
I heard the imperial court sent down

25
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:13,240
a Lord Su who has solved many strange cases.

26
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,480
What Lord Su?

27
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:16,600
How can a woman solve cases?

28
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,640
She probably used some crooked means

29
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:19,640
to get promoted.

30
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:21,520
Look at her figure and looks.

31
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:23,780
It's a pity for her to be a minor official.

32
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:29,520
The male corpse is Chen Wenyuan, the young master of Chen's Rice Shop.

33
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:32,800
The female corpse is Liu Rumei, the daughter of Liu's Silk Shop.

34
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,160
Both are married.

35
00:03:34,160 --> 00:03:35,400
They eloped seven days ago.

36
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,200
Last night,

37
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:37,160
they were suddenly cursed

38
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:38,400
and died accidentally.

39
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,280
Whose curse?

40
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:40,960
Lady Hong,

41
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:43,440
the most famous vengeful ghost here.

42
00:03:44,640 --> 00:03:46,480
Her original name was Lin Hongyuan.

43
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:48,240
She fell in love with a poor scholar

44
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:49,720
and made money to support his studies.

45
00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:50,720
After the scholar passed the imperial examination,

46
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:51,760
he abandoned her.

47
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:53,930
Lady Hong was sold to a brothel.

48
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:54,960
Unable to bear the humiliation,

49
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:58,090
she threw herself into the river and committed suicide.

50
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,330
This is no accident,

51
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:03,720
nor is it any vengeful ghost's revenge.

52
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:05,000
Both were married.

53
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:07,360
The most likely cause is a crime of passion.

54
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,600
Go investigate their families.

55
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:10,360
Have the coroner examine the bodies immediately.

56
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:12,220
I want to know their time of death.

57
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:13,960
This...

58
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,890
How do we investigate this?

59
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:17,380
Within three days,

60
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,649
I want to know the case details.

61
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:21,120
If you can do it, do it.

62
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:22,200
If not, leave.

63
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,120
You...

64
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:25,640
Lord Su,

65
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,460
you're really throwing your weight around.

66
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:31,120
Young master.

67
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:36,960
Lord Su,

68
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:39,640
you shouldn't speak so absolutely.

69
00:04:39,760 --> 00:04:40,960
What if you're wrong?

70
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:51,400
Who are you

71
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:52,640
to mislead the public with rumors?

72
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:54,320
Lord Su, don't go too far.

73
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:56,360
This is our magistrate's nephew.

74
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,760
He also came back from Chang'an.

75
00:04:57,760 --> 00:04:59,490
I don't care whose nephew he is.

76
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,600
He can't interfere with my case.

77
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:02,240
No...

78
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,360
And you guys,

79
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,320
three days.

80
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:09,840
You...

81
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:13,040
Who is she?

82
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,680
A petty official from Chang'an's Dali Court.

83
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:16,080
I heard she has bad intentions.

84
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:17,040
Rumor has it she wanted a promotion,

85
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,560
and even seduced her direct superior.

86
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:20,000
That's why she was demoted.

87
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:20,640
Yes.

88
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:30,000
Following our office's investigation

89
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:32,400
into the recent case of Chen Wenyuan and Liu Rumei,

90
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:33,800
it has been ruled an accident,

91
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:35,260
and the case is now closed.

92
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:36,360
Sir,

93
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,840
this case is absolutely no accident.

94
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:41,100
I will find out the truth within two days.

95
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:46,440
Investigate my ass!

96
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:53,280
The victim died of traumatic blood loss.

97
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:56,440
The killer sewed dozens of stitches with red thread.

98
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:58,240
I can't even pick them apart.

99
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,720
What is that tattoo?

100
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,080
It's called the Xuanji Tu.

101
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:04,680
It's a love poem written by Su Hui to her husband in the Former Qin.

102
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:06,680
It's a poem that can be read forwards and backwards.

103
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:07,880
It's also the poem that Hong Niangzi

104
00:06:07,880 --> 00:06:10,210
and her lover used as a token of their love.

105
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:12,240
What about the time of death?

106
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,500
It's still uncertain.

107
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:15,280
Find out as soon as possible.

108
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:21,200
Madam,

109
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:23,810
Lord Su from the county office is here.

110
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:31,480
Mrs. Chen,

111
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,580
where were you last night?

112
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:40,080
Madame was at home all night.

113
00:06:40,159 --> 00:06:42,880
Do you know about Chen Wenyuan and Liu Rumei?

114
00:06:43,159 --> 00:06:44,320
I just found out today.

115
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:46,360
He eloped with his little lover

116
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:47,480
and died.

117
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:50,080
And you're still in the mood to mourn him here?

118
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:53,680
Actually, Wenyuan and Liu Rumei were childhood sweethearts.

119
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:56,600
If his father hadn't forced him before he died,

120
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:57,920
he wouldn't have married me.

121
00:06:57,920 --> 00:07:00,040
I can only blame my bitter fate.

122
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:01,980
Have you heard about the Red Lady?

123
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,680
This is my husband's mourning hall.

124
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:09,040
Don't speak nonsense.

125
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:10,680
See the guest out.

126
00:07:14,080 --> 00:07:14,960
Lord Su,

127
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:17,340
my master is no longer pursuing this.

128
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:19,080
Please stop investigating.

129
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:29,080
From the county office.

130
00:07:29,080 --> 00:07:30,600
I want to see your young master.

131
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,080
My Lord,

132
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:33,720
my young master went to Chang'an to study a few days ago.

133
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:34,850
He hasn't returned.

134
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:39,680
Someone passed away in your family,

135
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:40,880
yet you haven't set up a mourning hall.

136
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:41,880
This is our family's affair.

137
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:44,140
There is no need for you to worry, Lord Su.

138
00:07:51,159 --> 00:07:52,159
Lord Su.

139
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:54,720
The Zhao family

140
00:07:54,960 --> 00:07:56,720
is a prominent and wealthy family.

141
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:58,180
Sneaking in so recklessly

142
00:07:58,320 --> 00:07:59,450
might be dangerous.

143
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:00,680
Are you following me?

144
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,300
Me, following you?

145
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:04,080
I am also a member of the county office,

146
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:06,140
and I am here to investigate the case.

147
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:09,080
A playboy like you wants to investigate a case?

148
00:08:09,560 --> 00:08:10,400
Don't follow me

149
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:11,800
and become a burden to me.

150
00:08:12,640 --> 00:08:15,080
Everyone says you rely on your beauty to get promoted.

151
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:15,560
You...

152
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:16,560
I...

153
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:18,620
I know you are not that kind of person.

154
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,860
Blow the whistle if you're in danger.

155
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:54,440
No,

156
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:57,400
you fool.

157
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:00,960
Damn it,

158
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:04,000
aren't you afraid of the Red Lady taking your life?

159
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:06,840
With the Heavenly Master's talisman,

160
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:08,040
there's nothing to fear.

161
00:09:08,040 --> 00:09:08,680
Come.

162
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:14,020
I am already carrying Chen Wenyuan's child.

163
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:17,520
Then tonight I must really

164
00:09:17,520 --> 00:09:18,760
teach him a lesson.

165
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:25,640
Slow down.

166
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:27,880
Zhao Huaijin,

167
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:29,140
what are you doing?

168
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:34,320
You found out about Chen Wenyuan and Liu Rumei,

169
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:35,450
and became jealous.

170
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:36,600
So,

171
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:38,960
by disguising as the Red Lady,

172
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:40,400
you killed them,

173
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:41,300
didn't you?

174
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:49,680
I was going to make a sacrifice today

175
00:10:49,680 --> 00:10:52,080
to send the Red Lady back to the underworld

176
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:53,960
by using a paper figure as a substitute.

177
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:55,960
But since you delivered yourself to me,

178
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:57,020
it's your bad luck.

179
00:10:57,920 --> 00:10:58,720
Zhao Huaijin,

180
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:01,000
stop playing tricks here.

181
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:02,160
Come out!

182
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:22,800
Knockout gas.
